d Option could take up to an hour to show up in\nrule-variable evaluation. Option/OptionSet writes arrive via\nDefaultOptionService, the generic metadata CRUD controller, or a\nmetadata import - none of which funnel through a single call site\nDefaultProgramRuleEntityMapperService could hook into directly, so\ninvalidation has to happen at the Hibernate level instead.\n\nAdd OptionCacheInvalidationListener, a PostCommit insert/update/delete\nlistener for the Option entity, registered globally via\nOptionCacheInvalidationListenerConfigurer - the same registration\npattern DeletedObjectListenerConfigurer already uses. This is same-node\nonly; a write committed on another node in a cluster still relies on\nthe existing 1h TTL as a backstop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"6d8a9eaea75e3370e0ec81542f90491594a19b06","tree_id":"a624023433c1100f4e1872a05ba252a41fcb3b47","timestamp":"2026-08-11T11:38:12Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starr